"""One git worktree per zellij tab, each tab running its own agent.

Run with no command to pick a clone and a branch instead of typing them.
"""

# CLAUDE_HOOK_SELFTEST: set this env var to run the embedded self-tests (`_selftest`).
# This marker line is how `claude-hook-selftests` discovers participating scripts.

